acceptance_criteria: "All 4 open code-scanning alerts are either fixed (REAL) or dismissed with timing evidence (NOT EXPLOITABLE); Timing regression tests added for fixed regexes, verified red on revert; Gates pass: check, test, coverage, docstring, changelog:full; PR opened from fix/measure-and-close-polynomial-redos-alerts branch"
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-01T08:23:34.895Z",pi-agent,"## Code-scanning alert measurement results (pm-beads)\n\n### Timing methodology\nEach flagged regex was measured with an adversarial input built from CodeQL's\nmessage. Times measured with `process.hrtime.bigint()` at n = 1000 / 4000 / 16000 / 64000.\n\n### Alerts 1–3 (lines 355, 375, 389): BEAD_ID_MARKER — REAL\nRegex: `/\\[bead_id:\\s*([^\\]]+)\\]/`\nThe `\\s*` and `[^\\]]+` both match spaces, causing O(n²) backtracking on failure.\nAll three exported entry points (encodeBeadId, decodeBeadId, stripBeadIdMarker) are affected.\n\n| n       | exec       | test       | replace    |\n|---------|------------|------------|------------|\n| 1000    | 1.139 ms   | 1.102 ms   | 1.135 ms   |\n| 4000    | 15.992 ms  | 15.224 ms  | 15.231 ms  |\n| 16000   | 280.609 ms | 245.142 ms | 257.257 ms |\n| 64000   | 4029.826 ms| 4046.348 ms| 4559.923 ms|\n\n**Fix:** Changed `[^\\]]+` to `[^\\]\\s]+` so the capture cannot match whitespace,\neliminating the overlap. Fixed regex: 0.180 ms at n=64000.\n\n### Alert 4 (line 482): incomplete-sanitization — fixed\n`new RegExp(...)` in test only escaped dots, not backslashes.\n**Fix:** Replaced with `assert.ok(out.includes(...))` — no regex needed.\n\n### Revert proof\nRestored old regex, ran timing tests: all 3 failed (stripBeadIdMarker took 4392 ms).\nRestored fix: all 3 passed (< 1 ms). Confirmed red-on-revert, green-on-fix.\n\n### Pre-existing health gate note\n`pm health --strict-exit` fails on `merge_receipt_evidence_invalid:4` which is\npre-existing on origin/main (confirmed at commit e8fe357). Attempted repair via\n`pm history-repair --all --normalize-provenance` and manual merge receipt cleanup\n— issue persists in the pm CLI's merge receipt evidence validation. Not caused\nby these changes."
tests[1]{command,path,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  npm test,test/smoke.test.ts,project,pi-agent,"2026-09-01T08:23:38.406Z",local_mutation,fix/measure-and-close-polynomial-redos-alerts
close_reason: "All 4 alerts resolved: BEAD_ID_MARKER regex fixed (O(n²) -> linear), incomplete-sanitization in test fixed, timing regression tests added and verified red-on-revert"
